  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><strong>About Our Brand &amp; Products</strong></h3><p>Clearly Better Scents is a premium scenting brand offering luxury fragrance oils, cold-air scent diffusers, and candles for both homes and businesses. Our products help transform spaces with long-lasting, high-quality scents inspired by luxury hotels and designer fragrances.</p><h3><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p>We deliver high-end, consistent scent performance without flames or harsh chemicals. Our diffusers provide even fragrance coverage, our oils are highly concentrated, and customers frequently return for refills and new fragrances.</p><h3><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p>Affiliates earn commission on every qualified sale they refer, including diffuser purchases and fragrance orders.</p><h3><strong>How to Promote Us</strong></h3><p>Clearly Better Scents performs well with home, lifestyle, décor, cleaning, self-care, and business-focused content. Affiliates can promote through social media, short-form video, blogs, email lists, and gift guides using real home or business scenting demonstrations.</p><h3><strong>Other Information</strong></h3><p>Approved affiliates receive a <strong>FREE diffuser and fragrance</strong> to create authentic content and showcase real results. Our products are visually appealing, easy to demonstrate, and designed for everyday home use. We also provide brand assets and ongoing support to help affiliates succeed.</p></div></div>",
